Usage: sha256sum [OPTION]... [FILE]...
Compute or verify SHA-256 digests. With no file, or with -, read stdin.
  -b, --binary      mark binary input with *
  -t, --text        mark text input with a space (default)
      --tag         write a BSD-style manifest
  -z, --zero        terminate with NUL and preserve raw filenames
  -c, --check       verify each entry of the manifests
      --ignore-missing  skip absent files and require at least one match
      --quiet       omit successful matches
      --status      indicate the result through the exit status
      --strict      fail on malformed lines as well
  -w, --warn        diagnose each malformed line
      --help        show this help
      --version     show the component version
Manifest paths are relative to the current working directory.
